\ The same reporting, for a cycle the loader rejects rather than a parse-time word that throws.
\ The rejection is raised while the loaded module's `use` runs, so it leaves through the parse-time
\ path too. Caught, it has always reported in full; uncaught, it took the bare fallback.
\
\ Interpreter-only. The compiled tier records two further `load` frames on this recursive chain,
\ so the two tiers render different caller lists for the one error.

